  "body": "MODERN SINGLE-LEVEL LOCK-UP & LEAVE!\r\n\r\nPositioned in one of Milford's most tightly held pockets, this single-level, move-in-ready home offers an easy-care lifestyle just moments from the beach, village, and local cafe's.\r\n\r\nBeautifully renovated throughout with nothing left to do, the home features a modern open-plan kitchen, light-filled living and seamless indoor-outdoor flow to a sunny patio. The open plan layout is perfect for relaxed everyday living or easy lock-up-and-leave living.\r\n\r\nEnjoy being just a short stroll from Milford Beach, Milford Village, cafe's, restaurants and public transport, all while being zoned for Milford Primary, Takapuna Normal Intermediate, Westlake Boys High School and Westlake Girls High School.\r\n\r\nMove-in-ready homes in this location are becoming increasingly hard to find.\r\n\r\nKey Features:\r\n* Single level.\r\n* Spacious modern kitchen.\r\n* Light-filled open plan living and dining.\r\n* 2 spacious double bedrooms.\r\n* Large modern bathroom with a walk-in shower.\r\n* Sunny, outdoor entertaining area perfect for BBQs. \r\n* Carport (with potential to convert to a garage, own DD required).\r\n* Heat pump for year-round comfort.\r\n* Short walk to Milford Beach, Milford Village & cafe's.\r\n* Zoned for Milford Primary, Takapuna Normal Intermediate, Westlake Boys High School & Westlake Girls High School.\r\n\r\nhttp://rwmairangibay.co.nz/MRG34955\r\n\r\nAll conjunctions welcome!",
